    "title": "Mobile food distribution event in La Porte February 18 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Becca Shepherd ,\n1 days ago The Food Bank of Northern Indiana will be holding a free mobile food distribution in La Porte tomorrow, Wednesday February 18th. The mobile food distribution will take place at the La Porte County Fairgrounds, at 2581 Indiana Highway 2 in La Porte, from 10am to noon Central Time, or as long as supplies last. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
